('m-as1-set-b-07', 1, '1.2.3', 'AS', 'short', 4, 'When the price of a coffee-pod machine falls from £120 to £96, monthly sales of compatible coffee pods rise from 50,000 boxes to 60,000 boxes. Calculate the cross elasticity of demand for coffee pods with respect to the price of the machine, and explain what your answer shows.', null, null, 'mock'),
